  "body": "With the advent of spaces, it looks like we probably need to rethink how we do room joins/invites. Doing this would probably be fairly tricky, as it'd be hard for a server to discern between legitimate quick-joins (e.g. Spaces' `auto_join` feature), quickly clearing a list of invites with \"accept\", and spam accounts joining a bunch of rooms to start spamming in them.\r\n\r\nBelow issues are overlapping in interest, but related to this bigger issue.\r\n\r\n- #8735\r\n- #8736\r\n- #9409\r\n- #8309\r\n- #9487\r\n\r\ncc @ara4n, @erikjohnston",
